        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この星に危機が訪れるとします。\n人間は全滅することでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A catastrophe threatens this world. Humanity stands on the brink of annihilation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、あなたの力をもってすれば、\n１０００人だけ救うことができるでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "However, with your power, you could save one thousand lives."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたはどうしますか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you do?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、私は……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... I...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ。あなたが「選択」をすれば、\nこの二人は無事解放される",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna. If you make your 'choice,' these two will be released unharmed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さもなくば、この二人の命は、無い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Otherwise, they will not survive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
