        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見たことのある拘束です。\nなんの対策もしてないわけないじゃないですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've seen restraints like that before. Did you really think I'd come unprepared?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あらかじめ、拘束を解除する道具を作っていました。\nこれが錬金術の力です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I made a tool to break them in advance. That's what alchemy can do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これと同じことです！\u3000何があろうと……\nどんな「選択」だって……錬金術で乗り越えてみせる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that's exactly my answer! No matter what happens... no matter what 'choice' you put before me... alchemy will see us through!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術は、みんなを幸せにする力！\n私はこの力と、可能性を信じてるんだ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alchemy is the power to make everyone happy! I believe in that power, and I believe in its potential!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確かにそれだけじゃできないこともあるかもしれない。\nでも、みんながいる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sure, there are things I can't do alone. But I'm not alone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やり遂げる意志がある限りできないことなんかない！\n私は、みんなを信じてるんだ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As long as we have the will to see it through, nothing is impossible! I believe in everyone here!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだよ。ずっとそばでレスナちゃんを見てきた。\nレスナちゃんがたくさんの人を救う姿を！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. I've been by your side this whole time, Resna. I've watched you save person after person!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私もレスナに救われた。レスナはこんな私にも、\n道を、未来を、示してくれた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She saved me too. Even someone like me—she showed me a path forward. A future I could believe in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなレスナちゃんをアタシたちは信じる！\n何が行く手を阻もうと、アタシたちが道を切り開く！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that's why we believe in her! Whatever stands in our way, we'll carve the road ourselves!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私だってヴァレリアをずっとそばで見てきた。\nこいつのすごさ、あんた知らないだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I've been right beside Valeria through all of it. You have no idea what she's capable of."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつはね、自分の命を失おうが、記憶を失おうが、\nそれでも自分の意志を貫いてきたんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This woman has lost her life, lost her memories, and still never once let go of who she is!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その姿が色んな人を動かすことを、私は知ってる！\n意志の力、舐めんじゃないよ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've seen how far that kind of will can move people. Don't you dare underestimate it!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "損得なんて考え方で人を救えるとは思わない。\n私は知ってる。大切なのは、寄り添うことだと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can't save people through cold calculation. I know that. What matters is standing beside them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様にはそれができる！\nそんな姉様を否定するというなら……斬る！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And Alvina can do that. If you're going to deny that... I'll cut you down!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがと、ベップ。嬉しいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Bepp. That means a lot."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんでね、いい加減うんざりなんすわ！\n全部余計なお節介だっつーの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And honestly? I am done with this! Every last bit of it is nothing but unwanted meddling!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちの道は私たちで決める。\nそうでしょ、レスナ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We decide our own path. Isn't that right, Resna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "絶対に負けない――みんな、行くよ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We are not losing this—let's go, everyone!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]